    [6633]={name="Butcher's Slicer",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Razorclaw the Butcher.",zone="Shadowfang Keep",npc="Razorclaw the Butcher"},
    [6659]={name="Scarab Trousers",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Escape Through Stealth'. Starts with Volcor in Darkshore. Objective: Escape the Furbolg cave and meet Terenthis in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Escape Through Stealth",lore="All right then... if you're sure, we'll sneak out of here. Let us leave when you're ready. Remember, after you've escaped, meet Terenthis back in Auberdine."},
    [6664]={name="Voodoo Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jin'Zil's Forest Magic'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Jin'Zil in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",lore="So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."},
    [6667]={name="Engineer's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ziz Fizziks in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Bring Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's Mechanical Arm to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",lore="I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."},
    [6669]={name="Sacred Band",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Den'. Starts with Braelyn Firehand in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Travel to the Den on Stonetalon Peak. Using the Gatekeeper's Key, obtain the druids' hidden items. Use these items to open the Talon Den Hoard.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="The Den",lore="The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."},
    [6677]={name="Spellcrafter Wand",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Retrieval for Mauren'. Starts with Collin Mauren in Stormwind City. Objective: Bring 8 Crystalized Scales to Collin Mauren in Stormwind.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Retrieval for Mauren",lore="Travelers keep asking me about the Stonetalon Mountains. It seems to be a popular place for adventure--it doesn't matter if you're seeking wyvern, elementals, or you have business with the Venture Co."},
    [6678]={name="Band of Elven Grace",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reception from Tyrande'. Starts with Sentinel Thenysil in Darnassus. Objective: Find Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reception from Tyrande",lore="I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."},
    [6682]={name="Death Speaker Robes",quality=3,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Death Speaker Jargba.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Death Speaker Jargba"},
    [6685]={name="Death Speaker Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=32,reqLevel=27,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Death Speaker Jargba.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Death Speaker Jargba"},
    [6689]={name="Wind Spirit Staff",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Earthcaller Halmgar.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Earthcaller Halmgar"},
    [6691]={name="Swinetusk Shank",quality=3,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Agathelos the Raging.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Agathelos the Raging"},
    [6693]={name="Agamaggan's Clutch",quality=3,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Charlga Razorflank.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Charlga Razorflank"},
    [6695]={name="Stygian Bone Amulet",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6697]={name="Batwing Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6713]={name="Ripped Pants",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Burning Blade Medallion'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zureetha Fargaze in Durotar. Objective: Bring the Burning Blade Medallion to Zureetha Fargaze, outside The Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [6726]={name="Razzeric's Customized Seatbelt",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Safety First'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shreev in Thousand Needles. Objective: Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Safety First",lore="There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."},
    [6729]={name="Fizzle's Zippy Lighter",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'News for Fizzle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Martek the Exiled in Thousand Needles. Objective: Speak with Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="News for Fizzle",lore="Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons."},
    [6737]={name="Dryleaf Pants",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Parts of the Swarm'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Korran in Orgrimmar. Objective: Return to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Parts of the Swarm",lore="Head back to Belgrom in Orgrimmar and tell him Moktar be doing his bidding well out in the Thousand Needles. Tell him also, that me studies progress, and I hope to be havin' learned more soon."},
    [6743]={name="Sustaining Ring",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Knowledge in the Deeps'. Starts with Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge. Objective: Bring the Lorgalis Manuscript to Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Knowledge in the Deeps",lore="As you might know, I collect lore. Old lore. Powerful lore. Lore that opens doorways, and lore that can awaken Those Who Sleep."},
    [6750]={name="Snake Hoop",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Willix the Importer'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6774]={name="Traitor's Finger",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6780]={name="Lilac Sash",quality=2,ilvl=36,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bounty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Melkins in Desolace. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
    [6791]={name="Hellion Boots",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Karnitol Shipwreck'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Desolace. Objective: Return to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Karnitol Shipwreck",lore="Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done. Haha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time."},
    [6797]={name="Eyepoker",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Questioning Reethe'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ogron in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Go with Ogron to speak with Reethe, then return to Krog in Brackenwall Village.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Questioning Reethe",lore="It took a long time, but I found Reethe. He hide good for a human. Ogron worried that he might be crazy after so much time in swamp. You come with me for we go get answers from him."},
    [6806]={name="Dancing Flame",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=36,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Final Passage', the last of ten steps. The chain starts with Test of Faith in Thousand Needles. Bring Beginnings of the Undead Threat out of Scarlet Monastery Library. That step is level 36. Pick the wand over the other reward.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Final Passage",lore="You have done well. You have passed my test, and the tests before mine. Return to Dorn in Thousand Needles."},
    [6834]={name="Black Tuxedo",quality=1,ilvl=1,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [6836]={name="Dress Shoes",quality=1,ilvl=1,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [6898]={name="Orb of Soran'ruk",quality=3,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Orb of Soran'ruk'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Doan Karhan in The Barrens. Objective: Find 3 Soran'ruk Fragments and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Orb of Soran'ruk",lore="Even fragmented, they still possess the powers of the demons trapped inside. The orb of Soran'ruk was broken into two pieces, one was further broken to be used by the acolytes of the Twilight's Hammer in Blackfathom Deeps.",proc="Use: Restores 48 health every 3 sec for 30 sec. (10 Min Cooldown)"},
    [6900]={name="Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",quality=3,ilvl=38,reqLevel=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Completed Robe'. Starts with Menara Voidrender in The Barrens. Objective: Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete your robe and then speak to her again.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Completed Robe",lore="I will put the robe together for you now. It will take but a few moments. Do not go far."},
    [6901]={name="Glowing Thresher Cape",quality=3,ilvl=29,reqLevel=24,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Old Serra'kis.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Old Serra'kis"},
    [6903]={name="Gaze Dreamer Pants",quality=3,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Twilight Lord Kelris.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Twilight Lord Kelris"},
    [6908]={name="Ghamoo-ra's Bind",quality=3,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ghamoo-ra.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Ghamoo-ra",lore="Ghamoo-ra is the ancient turtle the naga keep in Blackfathom Deeps -- old enough that the Twilight cultists there treat it as part of the temple."},
    [6910]={name="Leech Pants",quality=3,ilvl=29,reqLevel=24,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai"},
    [6998]={name="Nimbus Boots",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twilight Falls'. Starts with Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus. Objective: Bring 10 Twilight Pendants to Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Twilight Falls",lore="Empowered by the ancient rites of the chaotic Old Gods the members of the Twilight's Hammer strive to bring about the return of their dark patrons and spread death and terror across the world."},
    [7001]={name="Gravestone Scepter",quality=3,ilvl=29,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Blackfathom Villainy'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Blackfathom Villainy",lore="Strength has left me. Your help is needed! Long ago this site was a great temple of Elune. But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well."},
    [7004]={name="Prelacy Cape",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Researching the Corruption'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gershala Nightwhisper in Darkshore. Objective: Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine wants 8 Corrupt Brain stems.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Researching the Corruption",lore="Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor? I fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation."},
    [7026]={name="Linen Belt",quality=1,ilvl=9,reqLevel=4,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [7027]={name="Boots of Darkness",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
