    [10359]={name="Everlast Boots",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Power Stones'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rigglefuzz in Badlands. Objective: Bring 8 Dentrium Power Stones and 8 An'Alleum Power Stones to Rigglefuzz in the Badlands.",zone="Uldaman",questName="Power Stones",lore="A while ago, I had an incident with the Shadowforge Dwarves. They brought me to Angor Fortress to study two types of strange stones from Uldaman."},
    [10418]={name="Glimmering Mithril Insignia",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest \"Did You Lose This?\".",questName="Did You Lose This?",reqSkills={{"Blacksmithing",225}},proc="Use: Increases all Resistances by 10 and grants Immunity to Fear for 30 sec. (10 Min Cooldown)"},
    [10461]={name="Shadowy Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shadoweaver'. Starts with Nilith Lokrav in Searing Gorge. Objective: Kill the group of Shadow Silk Poachers that wander the Searing Gorge. Nilith has reason to believe that there are five of them that need to be exterminated. Return to Nilith in the Searing Gorge when this task is complete.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Shadoweaver",lore="The spiders of the Searing Gorge are an invaluable source of shadow silk. As you know, shadow silk is highly sought after by the artisans of our trade."},
    [10462]={name="Shadowy Belt",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Undermarket'. Starts with Nilith Lokrav in Searing Gorge. Objective: Slay Trade Master Kovic and his minion Clunk. Retrieve the Trader's Satchel from his corpse and return it to Nilith.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="The Undermarket",lore="They call themselves the Undermarket: Cutthroat traders that will sell, move, trade and do just about anything for the right price. It gets worse."},
    [10502]={name="Spellpower Goggles Xtreme",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",reqSkills={{"Engineering",215}}},
    [10503]={name="Rose Colored Goggles",quality=2,ilvl=46,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",reqSkills={{"Engineering",230}}},
    [10504]={name="Green Lens",quality=3,ilvl=49,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",reqSkills={{"Engineering",245}}},
    [10549]={name="Rancher's Trousers",quality=2,ilvl=12,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protecting the Herd'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rudra Amberstill in Dun Morogh. Objective: Rudra Amberstill wants you to slay Vagash and bring his fang to her at the Ram ranch.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="Protecting the Herd",lore="We heard the cries in the middle of the night. Then this morning, sure enough, the herd was missing two rams. That dastardly beast known as Vagash has been preying on our livelihood."},
    [10550]={name="Wooly Mittens",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Dun Morogh. Objective: Retrieve Tundra MacGrann's dried meats from the stolen meat locker in Old Icebeard's cave.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash",lore="I had a month's worth of dried meats salted and locked away for the cold season. Kept it locked so the bears wouldn't get it! But while I was off hunting deer, that beast, Old Icebeard, made off with the meat locker."},
    [10553]={name="Foreman Vest",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=8,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Gibblewilt.",zone="Dun Morogh",npc="Gibblewilt"},
    [10554]={name="Foreman Pants",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=8,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Gibblewilt.",zone="Dun Morogh",npc="Gibblewilt"},
    [10637]={name="Brewer's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sample for Helbrim'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Zinge in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Wolf Heart Sample to Apothecary Helbrim in the Barrens.",zone="Undercity",questName="Sample for Helbrim",lore="A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me."},
    [10638]={name="Long Draping Cape",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sample for Helbrim'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Zinge in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Wolf Heart Sample to Apothecary Helbrim in the Barrens.",zone="Undercity",questName="Sample for Helbrim",lore="A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me."},
    [10654]={name="Jutebraid Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Horde Presence'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kadrak in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Kill the leader of the Talon Den, Rynthariel the Keymaster.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Horde Presence",lore="This scroll is from that scheming dryad Rynthariel, Keymaster of the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak. She'll not be making any more contact with the messenger you looted this from, heh, but we must stand our ground here."},
    [10657]={name="Talbar Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In Nightmares'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Barrens",questName="In Nightmares",lore="This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream. However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare."},
    [10659]={name="Shard of the Splithooves",quality=2,ilvl=57,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Heroes of Old'. Starts with Corporal Thund Splithoof in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Open the chest and claim your reward.",zone="Blasted Lands",questName="Heroes of Old",lore="Please, take from this a relic of old. We no longer have a use for the item. May it serve you well in your fight against the legion."},
    [10700]={name="Encarmine Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Brood of Onyxia'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Draz'Zilb in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Speak with Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall Village.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="The Brood of Onyxia",lore="Onyxia's brood has been scattered across the Dragonmurk. It is imperative that no more whelps be permitted to hatch. Make haste to Wyrmbog in the south of Dustwallow Marsh."},
    [10704]={name="Chillnail Splinter",quality=2,ilvl=46,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Defeat Mok'Morokk and report the news to Draz'Zilb in Brackenwall Village.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk",lore="You dare challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk? Haw! Me crush tiny! You tell me when ready for good beating."},
    [10705]={name="Firwillow Wristbands",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doling Justice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jer'kai Moonweaver in Darnassus. Objective: Take Jer'kai's Signet Ring to High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",zone="Feralas",questName="Doling Justice",lore="Out here in the wilderness, Kindal and I have meager means to reward your help, but we don't want you to feel unappreciated. Take my signet ring."},
    [10708]={name="Skullspell Orb",quality=2,ilvl=52,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Tymor'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Return to Tymor",lore="Tymor didn't give me anything to pay you with, so I suggest you take it up with him when you get back to Ironforge. I'm sure he'll still be in his place in the Mystic Ward."},
    [10739]={name="Ring of Fortitude",quality=2,ilvl=53,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rise, Obsidion!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Dying Archaeologist in Searing Gorge. Objective: Slay Lathoric the Black and Obsidion, and return to Thorius in Ironforge with the Head of Lathoric the Black and the Heart of Obsidion.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Rise, Obsidion!",lore="It... It... It was all a trap. Forgive... me. Kill the bastard... Kill him for us... for Thorius."},
    [10747]={name="Teacher's Sash",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mazen's Behest'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mazen Mac'Nadir in Stormwind City. Objective: Speak with Acolyte Dellis in Stormwind.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="Mazen's Behest",lore="Master Mazen's directions were quite clear: Deliver a very important essay to Watcher Mahar Ba in Nethergarde Keep. But I had never been to the Blasted Lands before!"},
    [10751]={name="Gemburst Circlet",quality=3,ilvl=54,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The God Hakkar'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Yeh'kinya in Tanaris. Objective: Bring the Filled Egg of Hakkar to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.",zone="Sunken Temple",questName="The God Hakkar",lore="Now it is time to capture the essence of the avatar of Hakkar. Take the Egg of Hakkar to the Sanctum of the Fallen God in the Sunken Temple in Azeroth."},
    [10762]={name="Robes of the Lich",quality=3,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Amnennar the Coldbringer.",zone="Razorfen Downs",npc="Amnennar the Coldbringer"},
    [10771]={name="Deathmage Sash",quality=3,ilvl=41,reqLevel=36,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Mordresh Fire Eye.",zone="Razorfen Downs",npc="Mordresh Fire Eye"},
    [10779]={name="Demon's Blood",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'You Are Rakh'likh, Demon'. Starts with Fallen Hero of the Horde in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Destroy Razelikh the Defiler and return the Severed Horn of the Defiler to the Fallen Hero of the Horde. You will also need to return the Ward of the Defiler so that the Fallen Hero can destroy it, preventing it from ever falling into the wrong hands.",zone="Blasted Lands",questName="You Are Rakh'likh, Demon",lore="Razelikh's lair is atop the highest mountain in the Blasted Lands. The only way to the lair is through the use of the teleport runes near the mountain."},
    [10782]={name="Hakkari Shroud",quality=3,ilvl=51,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item.",zone="Un'Goro Crater"},
    [10802]={name="Wingveil Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=52,reqLevel=47,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Spawn of Hakkar.",zone="Sunken Temple",npc="Spawn of Hakkar"},
    [10807]={name="Kilt of the Atal'ai Prophet",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Jammal'an the Prophet.",zone="Sunken Temple",npc="Jammal'an the Prophet"},
    [10820]={name="Jackseed Belt",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mura Runetotem'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tonga Runetotem in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Speak with Mura Runetotem in the Sepulcher.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Mura Runetotem",lore="My clanmate, Mura Runetotem, traveled to Silverpine so that she might aid our undead allies. Silverpine is an ailing forest, a dying forest, and it was Mura's hope to bring it new life."},
    [10821]={name="Sower's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mura Runetotem'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tonga Runetotem in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Speak with Mura Runetotem in the Sepulcher.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Mura Runetotem",lore="My clanmate, Mura Runetotem, traveled to Silverpine so that she might aid our undead allies. Silverpine is an ailing forest, a dying forest, and it was Mura's hope to bring it new life."},
    [10824]={name="Amberglow Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=39,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bring the Light'.",zone="Razorfen Downs",questName="Bring the Light",lore="In the Barrens lies a horrid mess of tangled vines called Razorfen Downs. While our first observations of this place revealed little threat, our recent findings are much more serious..."},
    [10826]={name="Staff of Lore",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gahz'ridian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris. Objective: Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris wants you to collect 30 Gahz'ridian Ornaments.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Gahz'ridian",lore="I'm a scientist, but also a treasure hunter at heart! Long ago, when trolls used to occupy this land, they created large amounts of ornaments modeled after Gahz'rilla, a hydra they worshipped as a deity."},
    [10844]={name="Spire of Hakkar",quality=3,ilvl=54,reqLevel=49,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Avatar of Hakkar.",zone="Sunken Temple",npc="Avatar of Hakkar",proc="Equip: Harmful spell casts have a chance to steal 112 life from the target enemy over 8 sec. (10ms cooldown)"},
    [10919]={name="Apothecary Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Serpentbloom'. Starts with Apothecary Zamah in Wailing Caverns. Objective: Apothecary Zamah in Thunder Bluff wants you to collect 10 Serpentbloom.",zone="Wailing Caverns",questName="Serpentbloom",lore="A like you must get pretty hungry out here in The Barrens. Me, I'm starving all day long. Tell you what, I'll fix you up a nice stew. Just need a few dig rats."},
    [11123]={name="Rainstrider Leggings",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jammal'an the Prophet'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Atal'ai Exile in The Hinterlands. Objective: The Atal'ai Exile in The Hinterlands wants the Head of Jammal'an.",zone="Sunken Temple",questName="Jammal'an the Prophet",lore="My Witherbark companions don't take kindly to strangers around their home. Me? I don't have a home anymore. I was exiled from my people, the great Atal'ai tribe of the Swamp of Sorrows."},
    [11191]={name="Farmer's Boots",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Princess Must Die!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Princess Must Die!",lore="The Brackwells have a prize-winning pig, Princess. The sow is HUGE, and she got that way from sneaking over here and eating my veggies! So before she comes to our fields...Princess must die!"},
    [11196]={name="Mindburst Medallion",quality=2,ilvl=57,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tremors of the Earth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Garek in Badlands. Objective: Use the Sign of the Earth to activate the Pillars of Amethyst, Opal, and Diamond and obtain the Runestones.Place the runestones in the Seal of the Earth to free Blacklash and Hematus.Slay them and return Blacklash's Bindings, the Chains of Hematus, and the Sign of the Earth to Garek.",zone="Badlands",questName="Tremors of the Earth",lore="It has become obvious that we cannot ensure that Blacklash and Hematus will remain imprisoned in Lethlor."},
    [11262]={name="Orb of Lorica",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [11287]={name="Lesser Magic Wand",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=5,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Enchanting (requires skill 1).",profession="Enchanting"},
    [11288]={name="Greater Magic Wand",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=13,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Enchanting (requires skill 1).",profession="Enchanting"},
    [11289]={name="Lesser Mystic Wand",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Enchanting (requires skill 1).",profession="Enchanting"},
    [11469]={name="Bloodband Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Captain's Chest'. Objective: Bring Smotts' Chest to Hecklebury Smotts in Booty Bay.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="The Captain's Chest",lore="I used to sail a ship from here all the way to Ratchet, in Kalimdor. I was a successful captain with a sterling reputation. Until... Those cursed sea giants ruined me!"},
    [11623]={name="Spritecaster Cape",quality=3,ilvl=52,reqLevel=47,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Houndmaster Grebmar.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Houndmaster Grebmar"},
    [11634]={name="Silkweb Gloves",quality=3,ilvl=54,reqLevel=49,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Hedrum the Creeper.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Hedrum the Creeper"},
    [11748]={name="Pyric Caduceus",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Pyromancer Loregrain.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Pyromancer Loregrain"},
    [11750]={name="Kindling Stave",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Pyromancer Loregrain.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Pyromancer Loregrain",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [11810]={name="Force of Will",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from General Angerforge.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="General Angerforge"},
    [11811]={name="Smoking Heart of the Mountain",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Enchanting (requires skill 1).",profession="Enchanting",proc="Use: Increases armor by 520 for 20 sec. (6 Min Cooldown)"},
    [11812]={name="Cape of the Fire Salamander",quality=3,ilvl=58,reqLevel=53,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ambassador Flamelash.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Ambassador Flamelash",lore="Ragnaros's envoy to the Dark Iron in Blackrock Depths, sent to keep the dwarves loyal to the Firelord."},
    [11822]={name="Omnicast Boots",quality=3,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Golem Lord Argelmach.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Golem Lord Argelmach"},
    [11841]={name="Senior Designer's Pantaloons",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Fineous Darkvire.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Fineous Darkvire"},
    [11848]={name="Flax Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=2,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Scavenging Deathknell'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Deathguard Saltain in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Search Deathknell and the vicinity for 6 pieces of Scavenged Goods, and return them to Deathguard Saltain.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="Scavenging Deathknell",lore="You there! If you're looking for something to make yourself useful, then listen up! We need fresh out-of-the-ground recruits to head into Deathknell and search for any sort of useful equipment."},
    [11855]={name="Tork Wrench",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Samophlange Manual'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring the Samophlange Manual to Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Samophlange Manual",lore="I think I can fix the samophlange, but I'm going to need the user's manual first."},
    [11857]={name="Sanctimonial Rod",quality=2,ilvl=46,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Hero's Welcome'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feralas. Objective: Speak with Shandris Feathermoon in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Hero's Welcome",lore="General Shandris Feathermoon would like to speak with you personally."},
    [11859]={name="Jademoon Orb",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Grim Discovery'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Krueg Skullsplitter in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring the Crate of Grimtotem Horns to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Grim Discovery",lore="What?! Ah, so I did mention a bounty, didn't I? Well, that'll teach me to open my mouth, won't it? You did the work, so I suppose it is only right you reap the greatest reward from it."},
    [11860]={name="Charged Lightning Rod",quality=2,ilvl=46,reqLevel=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ledger from Tanaris'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Searing Gorge. Objective: Take the copy of Goodsteel's Ledger and then find the items listed in it before seeking Krinkle Goodsteel in Tanaris.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Ledger from Tanaris",lore="Oh, you know what? That reminds me. You wanna finish up a little job I took up while I was in Tanaris? It's easy... Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan was lookin' for some stuff found here in Searing Gorge and a few other places."},
    [11865]={name="Rancor Boots",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ribbly Screwspigot'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Yuka Screwspigot in Burning Steppes. Objective: Bring Ribbly's Head to Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Ribbly Screwspigot",lore="My brother Ribbly has always been a drain to his family, taking our money and wasting it on one scheme after another."},
    [11869]={name="Sha'ni's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Krom'Grul'. Starts with Sha'ni Proudtusk in Burning Steppes. Objective: Recover Sha'ni's Nose-Ring from Krom'Grul and return it to Thal'trak in Kargath. Search the various caves and mines in Dreadmaul Rock.",zone="Burning Steppes",questName="Krom'Grul",lore="My physical being ceased functioning after an hour of this torture. The beast then ripped my wedding nose-ring off of my face and stuck it on his finger."},
    [11873]={name="Ethereal Mist Cape",quality=2,ilvl=56,reqLevel=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ancient Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Arei in Ashenvale. Objective: Escort Arei to safety, then speak with Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song, in eastern Ashenvale.",zone="Felwood",questName="Ancient Spirit",lore="Felwood was once a peaceful and serene land... Until the legion took hold. The infernals, destruction, chaos... The skull of Gul'dan ensured that none were spared here."},
    [11875]={name="Breezecloud Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=54,reqLevel=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Further Corruption'. Starts with Eridan Bluewind in Felwood. Objective: Eridan Bluewind in Felwood wants you to kill 8 Jadefire Hellcallers, 8 Jadefire Betrayers, 8 Jadefire Tricksters, and Xavaric. Return to Eridan when the task is completed.",zone="Felwood",questName="Further Corruption",lore="A second encampment of satyrs threatens the land of Felwood towards the north, led by the cruel Xavaric. The vile betrayers and tricksters feed upon the corruption of the native creatures of Felwood."},
    [11884]={name="Moonlit Amice",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [11888]={name="Quintis' Research Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mystery of Morrowgrain'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quintis Jonespyre in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Morrowgrain to Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feathermoon Stronghold",questName="The Mystery of Morrowgrain",lore="Let me to be frank with you. I'm interested - nay, concerned with why the Arch Druid in Darnassus is using the name of the Cenarion Circle as well as the Circle's resources to procure vast amounts of morrowgrain."},
    [11904]={name="Spirit of Aquementas",quality=3,ilvl=56,reqLevel=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'It's Dangerous to Go Alone'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Linken in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero..."},
    [11908]={name="Archaeologist's Quarry Boots",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Roll the Bones'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Bring 8 Dinosaur Bones to Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Roll the Bones",lore="You'd think that being chief digger for Marshal Expeditions means I like digging. There might be worse things to do in this world... but none really leap to mind."},
    [11911]={name="Treetop Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Little Help From My Friends'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ringo in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Lead Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.If Ringo faints, use Spraggle's Canteen to revive him.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="A Little Help From My Friends",lore="Ugh... It's so hot... I was exploring this area, when all of a sudden, the heat just became unbearable. I must be suffering from heat exhaustion."},
    [11917]={name="Shizzle's Nozzle Wiper",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shizzle's Flyer'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Shizzle's Flyer",lore="I'm making a flying machine! I got stranded here, and I'm absolutely horrible at finding my way around. I'd take a gryphon or wind rider back to Gadgetzan, but those beasts just scare me to death."},
    [11936]={name="Relic Hunter Belt",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
    [11945]={name="Dark Iron Ring",quality=2,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",zone="Searing Gorge",npc="a container"},
    [11946]={name="Fire Opal Necklace",quality=2,ilvl=52,reqLevel=47,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",zone="Searing Gorge",npc="a container"},
