    [20443]={name="Sentinel's Blade",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Illiyana Moonblaze.",zone="Ashenvale",npc="Illiyana Moonblaze"},
    [20444]={name="Sentinel's Medallion",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Illiyana Moonblaze.",zone="Ashenvale",npc="Illiyana Moonblaze"},
    [20530]={name="Robes of Servitude",quality=3,ilvl=52,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Trolls of a Feather'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Felwood",questName="Trolls of a Feather",lore="My pet is almost done. Now I just need something to stuff it with. Only the voodoo feathers from the trolls in the sunken temple will do. They go by the names Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro."},
    [20536]={name="Soul Harvester",quality=3,ilvl=52,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Trolls of a Feather'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Felwood",questName="Trolls of a Feather",lore="My pet is almost done. Now I just need something to stuff it with. Only the voodoo feathers from the trolls in the sunken temple will do. They go by the names Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [20625]={name="Belt of the Dark Bog",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lethon.",npc="Lethon",lore="One of the corrupted green dragons, who tears the shades out of the living and drinks them back down."},
    [20641]={name="Southsea Mojo Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Southsea Shakedown'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Security Chief Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris. Objective: Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Southsea Shakedown",lore="They want the impossible from me! The Steamwheedle Cartel wants me to teach the Southsea pirates a lesson."},
    [20642]={name="Antiquated Nobleman's Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Oran's Gratitude'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity. Objective: Now isn't this interesting? You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, &lt;class&gt;? Very interesting indeed. I thank you for your efforts in this matter. Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery. Here, allow me to reward you proportionately.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Oran's Gratitude"},
    [20645]={name="Nature's Whisper",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="mail",instructions="Delivered by in-game mail."},
    [20647]={name="Black Crystal Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Silithus. Objective: Bring Deathclasp's Pincer to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard.",zone="Silithus",questName="Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands",lore="The terrible scorpid, Deathclasp, is believed to have retreated to the southern mountain range in the presence of increased silithid activity."},
    [20674]={name="Abyssal Cloth Pants",quality=3,ilvl=62,reqLevel=57,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from The Duke of Zephyrs.",npc="The Duke of Zephyrs"},
    [20682]={name="Elemental Focus Band",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Prince Skaldrenox.",zone="Silithus",npc="Prince Skaldrenox"},
    [20692]={name="Multicolored Band",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [20695]={name="Abyssal War Beads",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [20716]={name="Sandworm Skin Gloves",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Armaments of War'. Starts with Geologist Larksbane in Silithus. Objective: War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded.Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass...The future of us all could be at an end.These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert.",zone="Silithus",questName="Armaments of War"},
    [20724]={name="Corrupted Blackwood Staff",quality=2,ilvl=62,reqLevel=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Into The Maw of Madness'. Starts with Commander Mar'alith in Silithus. Objective: Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith.Do not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you.And &lt;name&gt;, remember the Commander's words: \"Do what you must...\".",zone="Silithus",questName="Into The Maw of Madness",lore="I need you to venture into Hive'Regal and find what became of my dearest Natalia. This will be no easy task for you. Before you dive headlong into the maw of madness, make sure that you go back and speak with those dwarves."},
    [21115]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing. Requires The Defilers - Friendly.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",reqRep={{"The Defilers","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 454 to 554 physical damage. Â Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21116]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing. Requires The Defilers - Friendly.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",reqRep={{"The Defilers","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 353 to 431 physical damage. Â Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21117]={name="Talisman of Arathor",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Samuel Hawke. Requires The League of Arathor - Friendly.",zone="Refuge Pointe",npc="Samuel Hawke",reqRep={{"The League of Arathor","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 454 to 554 physical damage. Â Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21118]={name="Talisman of Arathor",quality=3,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Samuel Hawke. Requires The League of Arathor - Friendly.",zone="Refuge Pointe",npc="Samuel Hawke",reqRep={{"The League of Arathor","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 353 to 431 physical damage. Â Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21119]={name="Talisman of Arathor",quality=3,ilvl=33,reqLevel=28,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Samuel Hawke. Requires The League of Arathor - Friendly.",zone="Refuge Pointe",npc="Samuel Hawke",reqRep={{"The League of Arathor","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 278 to 338 physical damage. Â Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21120]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=33,reqLevel=28,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing. Requires The Defilers - Friendly.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",reqRep={{"The Defilers","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 278 to 338 physical damage. Â Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21128]={name="Staff of the Qiraji Prophets",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from The Prophet Skeram.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="The Prophet Skeram",lore="C'Thun's mouthpiece. Everything the qiraji believe, they believe because he told them the Old God said it."},
    [21183]={name="Earthpower Vest",quality=3,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Veteran's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 7 Cenarion Combat Badges, 4 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 4 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Veteran's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21185]={name="Earthcalm Orb",quality=4,ilvl=62,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stalwart's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Stalwart's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21186]={name="Rockfury Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=62,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stalwart's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Stalwart's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21273]={name="Blessed Qiraji Acolyte Staff",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 2.0%."},
    [21275]={name="Blessed Qiraji Augur Staff",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."},
    [21311]={name="Earth Warder's Vest",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timbermaw Ally'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners.",zone="Felwood",questName="Timbermaw Ally",lore="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."},
    [21318]={name="Earth Warder's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21334]={name="Doomcaller's Robes",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Robes'. Starts with Vethsera in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Robes",lore="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21335]={name="Doomcaller's Mantle",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Mantle'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Mantle",lore="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21336]={name="Doomcaller's Trousers",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Trousers'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Skin of the Great Sandworm, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Trousers",lore="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance. The ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21337]={name="Doomcaller's Circlet",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Circlet'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Circlet",lore="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21338]={name="Doomcaller's Footwraps",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Footwraps'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Clay Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Footwraps",lore="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon."},
    [21417]={name="Ring of Unspoken Names",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ring of Unspoken Names'. Starts with Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Ceremonial Ring, 2 Jasper Idols, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Ring of Unspoken Names",lore="The gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior. Bring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21418]={name="Shroud of Unspoken Names",quality=4,ilvl=67,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shroud of Unspoken Names'.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Shroud of Unspoken Names",lore="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy."},
    [21468]={name="Mantle of Maz'Nadir",quality=3,ilvl=74,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Moam.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Moam",lore="A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."},
    [21489]={name="Quicksand Waders",quality=3,ilvl=73,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Buru the Gorger.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Buru the Gorger"},
    [21504]={name="Charm of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21517]={name="Gnomish Turban of Psychic Might",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Only Prescription'. Starts with Narain Soothfancy in Molten Core. Objective: Recover the 8 lost chapters of Draconic for Dummies and combine them with the Magical Book Binding and return the completed book of Draconic for Dummies: Volume II to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Only Prescription",lore="I should have known. My arch-enemy, Doctor Weavil, up to his old tricks! And now, thanks to your failure in Winterspring, Doctor Weavil has destroyed my book!"},
    [21521]={name="Runesword of the Red",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Treasure of the Timeless One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jonathan the Revelator in Silithus. Objective: Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun.",zone="Silithus",questName="Treasure of the Timeless One"},
    [21523]={name="Fang of Korialstrasz",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Treasure of the Timeless One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jonathan the Revelator in Silithus. Objective: Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun.",zone="Silithus",questName="Treasure of the Timeless One"},
    [21565]={name="Rune of Perfection",quality=3,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from the Warsong Gulch quartermaster with marks of honor. Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21566]={name="Rune of Perfection",quality=3,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from the Warsong Gulch quartermaster with marks of honor. Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21585]={name="Dark Storm Gauntlets",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21597]={name="Royal Scepter of Vek'lor",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'lor.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'lor",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21600]={name="Boots of Epiphany",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'lor.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'lor",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other."},
    [21608]={name="Amulet of Vek'nilash",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'nilash.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'nilash",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the stronger arm of the pair. Kill one and the other heals him, so both must fall together.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21611]={name="Burrower Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ouro.",zone="Silithus",npc="Ouro",lore="A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."},
    [21615]={name="Don Rigoberto's Lost Hat",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ouro.",zone="Silithus",npc="Ouro",lore="A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."},
    [21619]={name="Gloves of the Messiah",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Princess Huhuran.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Princess Huhuran",lore="A qiraji brood matron whose poison is potent enough that the fight is really a race against her venom."},
    [21622]={name="Sharpened Silithid Femur",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Viscidus.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Viscidus",lore="A living mass of qiraji poison. It has to be frozen solid and then shattered, which is not how most things die.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21648]={name="Recomposed Boots",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Battleguard Sartura.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Battleguard Sartura",lore="The qiraji empire's finest soldier, who fights with her honour guard and refuses to be separated from them."},
    [21663]={name="Robes of the Guardian Saint",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Fankriss the Unyielding.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Fankriss the Unyielding",lore="A vast qiraji burrower that spawns its young mid-fight and hurls intruders into the walls."},
    [21678]={name="Necklace of Purity",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Battleguard Sartura.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Battleguard Sartura",lore="The qiraji empire's finest soldier, who fights with her honour guard and refuses to be separated from them."},
    [21707]={name="Ring of Swarming Thought",quality=4,ilvl=73,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from The Prophet Skeram.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="The Prophet Skeram",lore="C'Thun's mouthpiece. Everything the qiraji believe, they believe because he told them the Old God said it."},
    [21709]={name="Ring of the Fallen God",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Savior of Kalimdor'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Caelestrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Savior of Kalimdor",lore="To the Caverns of Time you go, Lord:Lady;. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21836]={name="Ritssyn's Ring of Chaos",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 60-62.",zone="Silithus",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21888]={name="Gloves of the Immortal",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 60-62."},
    [22070]={name="Deathmist Belt",quality=3,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Just Compensation'. Starts with Mokvar in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Just Compensation",lore="I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade."},
    [22071]={name="Deathmist Bracers",quality=3,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'An Earnest Proposition'. Starts with Deliana in Ironforge. Objective: Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Lightforge Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",zone="Ironforge",questName="An Earnest Proposition",lore="I have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor."},
    [22072]={name="Deathmist Leggings",quality=3,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."},
    [22073]={name="Deathmist Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."},
