    [22630]={name="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",quality=5,ilvl=90,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian'. Objective: Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",lore="The Guardian's staff, broken and scattered. Rebuilding it means gathering forty splinters from Naxxramas, the base from Kel'Thuzad, and carrying it to the ruin of Karazhan where Medivh once held it.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 2.0%."},
    [22655]={name="Glacial Wrists",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glacial Wrists'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 2 Bolts of Runecloth, 2 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Glacial Wrists",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial wrists."},
    [22657]={name="Amulet of the Dawn",quality=4,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power?"},
    [22667]={name="Bracers of Hope",quality=4,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge."},
